{
  "schema": "GS-VOICE-SELF-REFERENCE-PRECEDENTS-V1",
  "source_head": "0e4d3949",
  "speaker": "017kir",
  "criteria": "Current source-bound reviewed TM; no literal ワガハイ in source; 吾辈 in translation. Historical precedent, not a new approval.",
  "examples": [
    {
      "key": "metadata:v1:card-line:normal:99a70c329f2b21142ecf20f4387feeb5023a5723a5818e0010a9847739475c75",
      "source": "ほうほう……これはまた、にゃんとも\n素敵な扇子でにゃんすな！　えいやーっと\nじゃんぷする、元気いっぱいな猫の姿……。\n……むむっ。むむむっ。この猫をてぇまに、\n新たな小噺がひらめきそうな予感がするぞなもし！",
      "translation": "吼吼……这还真是把妙不可言的\n漂亮折扇喵！嘿呀一声\n跳跃起来的、活力满满的猫咪身姿……\n……唔唔。唔唔唔。以这只猫为主题，\n吾辈预感能想出崭新的小段子是也！",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "batch": "G-card-lines-002",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "card-line",
          "id": "017kir_sr06",
          "field": "normal",
          "speaker": "017kir"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "metadata:v1:card-touch:text:2637ac168b0b61a3a6b697b98ac4cac85a4dcbe1fdd110a5dec2abec4ae7ba62",
      "source": "公園の猫クンが雨風を凌げる\nように、大きな葉っぱを\n探しているところでにゃんす！",
      "translation": "为了让公园的猫咪君能遮风避雨，\n吾辈正在找大叶子\n喵！",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "batch": "G-card-lines-002",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "card-touch",
          "id": "017kir_ssr02:2_4_017_02_00_03",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "017kir"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "metadata:v1:card-touch:text:3b2f747f711669911e1aae8cda82d804bdab4afa76c7cab21926804169683150",
      "source": "もののけに混ざってくろークンを\nびっくりさせたら、もののけより\n怖～い雷を食らったぞなもし。",
      "translation": "吾辈混进妖怪里吓了九郎君\n一跳，结果挨了顿比妖怪还\n可怕～的天雷是也。",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "batch": "G-card-lines-002",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "card-touch",
          "id": "017kir_sr09:2_3_017_09_00_01",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "017kir"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "metadata:v1:card-touch:text:4722c57b4e561228017ad68c3ad793d5eab6dbdb1d1ccb19c61d46b3e1547f43",
      "source": "いつもぷろでゅぅすしてくれる\nプロデューサークンには、\n感謝感謝でにゃんす♪",
      "translation": "对于一直为吾辈担任制作的\n制作人君，\n感激不尽喵♪",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "batch": "G-card-lines-002",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "card-touch",
          "id": "017kir_sr02:2_3_017_02_00_02",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "017kir"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "metadata:v1:card-touch:text:a12f7cdca783f566e0ee21f715b95879a4d150303d20eaca7cb676caf1da1b13",
      "source": "プロデューサークンに\nここだけのすぺしゃるな小噺を\n披露するでにゃんす！",
      "translation": "吾辈要为制作人君表演一段\n独一无二的特别小段子喵！",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "batch": "G-card-lines-002",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "card-touch",
          "id": "017kir_sr03:2_3_017_03_00_09",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "017kir"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "metadata:v1:card-touch:text:ae3db39f3a9bb70a3d5df7245ce230ebee1128d4b5d6f9dbc72ad385c3b869ef",
      "source": "プロデューサークンは、\nいつも新しい閃きを\nくれるでにゃんすな。",
      "translation": "制作人君总是能\n带给吾辈崭新的灵感喵。",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "batch": "G-card-lines-002",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "card-touch",
          "id": "017kir_sr11:2_3_017_11_00_02",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "017kir"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "metadata:v1:card-touch:text:b0bbb9b5bd83ab9b863320d0ae2d8e61b042e82754645acf943d17eab1407200",
      "source": "●●●●プロデューサークンを\n形態模写するため、今日一日\n観察するでにゃんすよ～！",
      "translation": "为了模仿●●●●プロデューサー君，\n吾辈今天一整天都要\n观察你喵～！",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "batch": "G-card-lines-002",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "card-touch",
          "id": "017kir_sr01:2_3_017_01_00_02",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "017kir"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "metadata:v1:card-touch:text:dc41283d85615e0901bead546d2b2916db0b2900ef6ae21897ba43119a76d3fb",
      "source": "新しい衣装の至るところに\n込められた彩らしさ。とっても\n気に入ったでにゃんすよ♪",
      "translation": "新服装各处都倾注了\n彩的特色。吾辈超级\n中意喵♪",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "batch": "G-card-lines-002",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "card-touch",
          "id": "017kir_sr06:2_3_017_06_00_09",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "017kir"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "metadata:v1:card-touch:text:e3b6d3a2f4f41fe96d586875facf6559f7d6b915104183558f788941fddca892",
      "source": "牧場は面白い動物がたくさん\nいるぞなもし。動物の形態模写\nには絶好の場でにゃんしたなぁ。",
      "translation": "牧场里有好多有趣的动物\n是也。真是吾辈模仿动物形态的\n绝佳场地喵。",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "batch": "G-card-lines-002",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "card-touch",
          "id": "017kir_ssr03:2_4_017_03_00_09",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "017kir"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
